{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890200/extras/168f2f6fcc33ac5a7faa320c0e653c4c.poster.avif?t=1757192591\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890200/extras/168f2f6fcc33ac5a7faa320c0e653c4c.webm?t=1757192591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890200/extras/168f2f6fcc33ac5a7faa320c0e653c4c.mp4?t=1757192591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1-4 players horror dungeon crawling X creature collection &amp; farming </strong> <br><strong>R.E.P.O. meets Slime Rancher!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into shifting dungeons with physics objects to throw and terrifying monsters to trap!</strong><br> <strong>Imprison them in your decaying basement lair, farm and feed them cursed crops, then sell them to crazy buyers or sacrifice them in dark magic rituals.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> dangerous, procedurally generated dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture terrifying monsters</strong> by weakening and trapping them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics objects</strong> to pick up and throw at monsters (or at your friends!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather</strong> <strong>resources</strong> in the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return</strong> to your base alive with your trapped monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imprison &amp; farm &amp; sell</strong> the monsters in your basement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow cursed crops</strong> to feed your monsters to produce dark resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill monsters</strong> and use them to feed your caged monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrifice altar</strong> to create upgrades by sacrificing monsters using dark magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rare variations</strong> of monsters: shiny/aggressive/photosensitive/gluttonous!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow baby monsters</strong> that run around in your basement from rare eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw magic sigils\u00a0</strong>to capture monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Answer disturbing voice calls</strong> from potential monster buyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and expand</strong> your basement, gear, and creature cages. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock dungeons</strong> and dive deeper &amp; capture scarier and more valuable monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automate</strong> the feeding and collecting of resources from monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon modifiers</strong>\u00a0to find mid-run that completely change the dungeon!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret portals</strong> and other entrances within dungeons leading to secret dungeons!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op or singleplayer, 1-4 players!</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890200?t=1757192591","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3890200?t=1757192591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890200/9d6d662f0049ef67e66058cc2d04ce6c117bb37e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757192591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3890200/9d6d662f0049ef67e66058cc2d04ce6c117bb37e/c